  "answer": "A small one-hall mosque with ceiling fans, tube lights, 1.5 ton inverter ACs, a water pump, a dispenser and a sound system needs about 7.61 kW of solar (13 panels of 585 W) with a 6.93 kW inverter in Lahore. System size is the larger of daily units ÷ sun yield and running watts ÷ performance ratio.",
  "formula": {
   "text": "kW = max(E_day ÷ yield, P_run ÷ 1000 ÷ PR); panels = ceil(kW × 1000 ÷ W_panel)",
